            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Mask_group.png",
            "alt": "",
            "quote": "“Many women don’t realize that waking up hot or sweaty isn’t just uncomfortable, it fragments their sleep architecture… That's why optimizing your sleep environment for temperature regulation by lowering your thermostat and investing in bedding with cooling technology can be just as important as addressing internal factors.”",
